    "description": "build.mjs fetches the 33 site files from raw.githubusercontent.com (fallback: cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh) at the pinned commit 812de15 and aborts unless each file byte length and SHA-256 match the values in `files` above, then writes them to ./public. The deployment therefore contains exactly the repo bytes of the pinned commit; this is the same pattern as the v20 deploy. The script was generated from the local checkout and dry-run locally (33/33 files byte-identical) before deploying."
