  "notes": [
    "The repository is public (gh: visibility PUBLIC), which is what makes the pinned-commit fetch possible; the ~665 KB site tree was therefore not inlined into the MCP request (a single inlined payload with base64 binaries would have been ~750 KB and error-prone).",
    "Git-linked auto-deploy was not used: get_git_deployment_context shows no linked Git projects in the singularity16 team, and create_git_project requires teamId (the 403 trigger) and cannot re-link an existing unlinked project such as proklinator-static.",
    "teamId was omitted from deploy_to_vercel, as in the prior successful deploys; no 403 occurred. Team-scoped read endpoints (get_deployment) still return 404 for this token, so the build was followed and verified over HTTP against the raw deployment URL and the public alias.",
    "The existing project proklinator-static was reused (protection already off); no new project was created and no auth/SSO/protection settings were touched. Registration and payments were not opened.",
    "HUGINN was not touched."
